Short:        Patches any version of MONAM to version 3.09
Author:       Aldo Vinattieri
Uploader:     solotre mbox vol it (Ferruccio Zamuner - 2 Settembre 1996)
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos


This little program update ANY version of Monam program by Hisoft to a new
3.09 version, that read any library, device & resource.

It is an evolution of previous CLI patcher program: You don't need an assign
to FD or INCLUDE directory, You can choose from a file (NdR » directory)
requester this.


ATTENTION PLEASE !!! YOU CANNOT CREATE MONAM.LIBFILE WITHOUT MONAM PROGRAM


